{
  "_comment": "Setting fragment for the Note pyramid. DATA WARNING: only 18 of 56 products have machine-readable notes and the store has zero custom metafields (_CORRECTIONS.md §2, 03-DATA-SCHEMA.md §7). `hide_when_empty` exists because ~38 of 56 products will render the empty state today.",
